(7035315, 1067447, 114969, '<td valign="top">What I like the most in your shot is the contrast between the dark grey water and the colorful horizon, it really gives it an interesting mood. Congratulations on your ribbon!</td>', 'What I like the most in your shot is the contrast between the dark grey water and the colorful horizon, it really gives it an interesting mood. Congratulations on your ribbon!', '2013-05-10 05:41:08.000000', NULL, 0),
