(7035856, 1067633, 102315, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the story that goes with this. Reminds me of the Jazzland/Six Flags that was struggling before Katrina struck New Orleans in 2005. Six Flags shut down in preparation of the coming storm and never reopened. It''s been a few years since I have passed through that area but I think the rides still sit there today unused and overgrown.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.lovethesepics.com/2011/05/creepy-crusty-crumbling-illegal-tour-of-abandoned-six-flags-new-orleans-75-pics/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Here</a> are some really cool pics taken in 2011</td>', 'Thanks for the story that goes with this. Reminds me of the Jazzland/Six Flags that was struggling before Katrina struck New Orleans in 2005. Six Flags shut down in preparation of the coming storm and never reopened. It''s been a few years since I have passed through that area but I think the rides still sit there today unused and overgrown. Here are some really cool pics taken in 2011', '2013-05-11 15:25:07.000000', NULL, 0),
